{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#card-zh","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：在 DSH 的 HTML 预览中圈选界面元素或区域，并把目标信息交给 agent。它注册 HTML/HTM 文档预览，在沙箱页面中提供悬停高亮、左键点选和拖框选择。选中后会整理 DOM 选择器、标签、文本、HTML 片段与可匹配的文件行列位置，并通过输入框引用和主机上下文传递。还会内联本地相对资源，并允许调整单文档大小上限。适合需要让 agent 修改网页某个具体组件的开发者；无需 API key，预览需读取本地文档及相关资源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:277-315","lib/client.js:659-670","lib/index.js:170-176","lib/inline.js:131-171"]}
{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#card-en","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pointer adds HTML preview selection to DSH. Click an element or drag across a region to send its selector, summary, and matched source location to the agent through an input reference and host context. It also inlines local assets for preview. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:277-315","lib/client.js:659-670","lib/index.js:170-176","lib/inline.js:131-171"]}
