{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#feature-1","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer 的功能「元素点选」：在预览中开启指代模式后左键选择元素；插件整理选择器、标签、文本和 HTML 摘要，并作为引用交给 agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:277-287","lib/client.js:99-115"]}
{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#feature-2","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer 的功能「区域框选」：拖动框出页面区域后，插件筛选其中的可见元素并整理成区域目标，供 agent 识别页面中的一组组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:289-315","lib/client.js:218-246"]}
{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#feature-3","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer 的功能「源码位置映射」：插件将选中元素的 HTML 与原始文档匹配，生成文件行列位置；内联资源会还原后再尝试匹配。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:607-639","lib/client.js:613-620"]}
{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#feature-4","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer 的功能「相对资源预览」：预览加载时读取 HTML 引用的本地相对资源，将图片等转成 data URL，并将 CSS 链接内联，便于在预览中显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/inline.js:131-171","lib/inline.js:180-200"]}
{"unit_id":"Phonky-Chou__dsh-pointer#caveat-1","repo":"Phonky-Chou/dsh-pointer","commit":"a89326c497191878bfb866cbc9b2329d3d6f0c8d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pointer 会读取被预览的本地 HTML 和相对资源，并将选择上下文、设置及调试信息写入 ~/.dsh/。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/inline.js:131-171","lib/index.js:14-22","lib/index.js:201-209"]}
